// A harness script (`net::harness::Script`): the release smoke's session, the tank parked and
// never firing for 256 fixed ticks (DERIVED: 4 s at 64 Hz), then a clean exit. From the checkout
// root, against a local server:
//
//   OVERMATCH_HARNESS=scripts/harness/idle.ron OVERMATCH_SERVER=127.0.0.1:5888 target/debug/overmatch
//
// runs GPU-less (no `OVERMATCH_WINDOW`). The run length is session configuration (ASSUMED), not
// game data.
(
    drive: Idle,
    ticks: 256,
)
